out of her own place, and ends up on Quinn's doorstep.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yqTBpVchb5WndUMXkbRlYKpSg1A.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":64,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-03\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Practically Perfect\",\"overview\":\"In an effort to create more free time to stalk and kill victims, Dexter hires a nanny; Debra is annoyed by her new partner, a rookie with her own theories on a bizarre double homicide; Quinn pursues the theory that Trinity did not kill Rita.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mS2DyP1K7MbA1IybP68umiXsFeW.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"voteCount\":63,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-10\",\"runtime\":49},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Beauty and the Beast\",\"overview\":\"Dexter finds himself in a strange situation when, instead of taking a life, he has to save one. Deb has a scary confrontation with a key suspect in the Santa Muerte murder cases; Quinn continues following up on the strange similarities between \\\"Kyle Butler\\\" and Dexter Morgan.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/82SPJjIJP7xvViWD0xOgDLezdOs.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":65,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-17\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"First Blood\",\"overview\":\"When Dexter is saddled with an unwanted conspirator, he is forced to make some hard decisions about her fate; meanwhile, Dexter wonders if Rita's death has awakened a darkness inside Harrison; due to Quinn's recent suspension, Debra works the Santa Muerte case alone, leaving Quinn time to enlist an old friend to look into Dexter.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eR3jzZ6WKD09ocsxq5fRGHuGqMX.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"voteCount\":65,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-24\",\"runtime\":51},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Everything Is Illumenated\",\"overview\":\"Trying to get his life back on track, Dexter hunts a new target, but is distracted and drawn into a precarious situation while helping his troubled acquaintance; Batista discovers an interesting lead in the Santa Muerte murder cases; Quinn learns some new information about Dexter from a questionable source.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kpa3E6ynZdFORmEJzvjzMnEukOM.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"voteCount\":70,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-31\",\"runtime\":50},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Circle Us\",\"overview\":\"While helping Lumen, Dexter finds himself on a collision course with Debra and the rest of Homicide when he is called to investigate a horrifying crime scene; the Santa Muerte case leads to a violent standoff between Debra and the killers.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yWmgJkvzS1zx7YhqCfgVf1r1Ovq.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"voteCount\":65,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-07\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Take It!\",\"overview\":\"While attending a self-help seminar, Dexter and Lumen stalk a violent killer; Debra gets into unexpected trouble from the fallout of the Santa Muerte case, forcing Batista to make a difficult decision.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sxQcDzAseVJkiUXqIXfWaTiRYYw.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":66,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-14\",\"runtime\":52},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Teenage Wasteland\",\"overview\":\"In the midst of hunting their next victim, Dexter and Lumen are surprised by the return of an unannounced guest; Debra is assigned to the file room, but manages to uncover new evidence in the Barrel Girl case.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eoxBiNdnAxI1mTcIdHXcn6jSoN0.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":65,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-21\",\"runtime\":55},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"In the Beginning\",\"overview\":\"Dexter discovers a possible ally in the pursuit of Lumen's former captors, but he and Lumen are forced to step down when homicide uncovers evidence linked to one of their prior victims; Debra identifies two more suspects in the Barrel Girls case.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s9xVM0xayQbGaGD6ttARrSVsySm.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":65,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-28\",\"runtime\":54},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Hop a Freighter\",\"overview\":\"Dexter is forced to do damage control after he concedes that someone outside of Miami Metro has taken an interest in him and Lumen; Debra's speculation on the missing Barrel Girl suspects begins to take shape; Quinn becomes more involved in a homicide than he'd like to be.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xJw2WiS3uHpMaFmwv90oY7Mq6qC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"voteCount\":63,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-05\",\"runtime\":47},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"The Big One\",\"overview\":\"Dexter realizes that he and Lumen are being lured into a trap and risks everything to escape; Debra lets her personal feelings overwhelm her instincts in the Barrel Girls case; Quinn needs help that only Dexter can provide.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fbAGakIEtwPpqi573MsseIDXE9s.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"voteCount\":66,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-12\",\"runtime\":55}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2006-10-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}